  "assignment_basis": "Bind the 110 exact stable keys published in issue #387 to their unique WP-209/WP-210 source-family declarations. Assign the six named cancellation, node-config, post-device-add and teardown cases to their corresponding concerns; CM-03 is the exact remainder required by its declared 104-family count. This is supervised traceability, not parity acceptance.",
